{"3479170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RHYTHMIC", "steam_appid": 3479170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RHYTHMIC is a VR spell-combat game where music is LITERALLY magic! <br>The rhythm will spawn mana particles that you must collect to conjure your spells. Each song is one round of intense physics-based magic combat. Stand as the last defender of your realm against relentless waves of enemies, intent on breaching your gate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/5d3868778b46285a93a9b3cc1235f7cb.avif?t=1770524781\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras_big/5d3868778b46285a93a9b3cc1235f7cb.webp?t=1770524781 width=1560 height=141 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/a21125a5da9d3e266498e54d2ebf837d.poster.avif?t=1770524781\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/a21125a5da9d3e266498e54d2ebf837d.webm?t=1770524781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/a21125a5da9d3e266498e54d2ebf837d.mp4?t=1770524781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the music and gather your mana. Throw spells at invaders and exploit their weaknesses! Each map hosts a different kind of enemy type, each with their own unique abilities. Prove your coordination and cunning to survive each song.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/505f43271c996c186ddf9c87f18389ba.avif?t=1770524781\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras_big/505f43271c996c186ddf9c87f18389ba.webp?t=1770524781 width=1560 height=141 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/cbfbd8a9d6aa5a90f637a02f0538042b.poster.avif?t=1770524781\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/cbfbd8a9d6aa5a90f637a02f0538042b.webm?t=1770524781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/cbfbd8a9d6aa5a90f637a02f0538042b.mp4?t=1770524781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The music is the source of all power in this realm! Magical particles spawn in tune with the rhythm. Catch as many as you can to power your spells!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/14264c8207f9bfec75f834484d386b3d.avif?t=1770524781\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras_big/14264c8207f9bfec75f834484d386b3d.webp?t=1770524781 width=1560 height=141 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/2b340d5d78b4b83532a32ab4142cef97.poster.avif?t=1770524781\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/2b340d5d78b4b83532a32ab4142cef97.webm?t=1770524781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/2b340d5d78b4b83532a32ab4142cef97.mp4?t=1770524781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They will attack relentlessly! Aim well, exploit each enemy's weakness with the right kind of magic, and play around their abilities to be as effective as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/6c31645bf9b49a0b507fa65eeb9eec20.avif?t=1770524781\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras_big/6c31645bf9b49a0b507fa65eeb9eec20.webp?t=1770524781 width=1560 height=141 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/ceaa2a5abaa4581bb9e280bb13066606.poster.avif?t=1770524781\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/ceaa2a5abaa4581bb9e280bb13066606.webm?t=1770524781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/ceaa2a5abaa4581bb9e280bb13066606.mp4?t=1770524781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out! Some enemies will fight back. Avoid their attacks or lose your charged mana, take too many hits and you will face an early defeat! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚔️ Not Your Typical Rhythm Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RHYTHMIC borrows from several genres but plays like none of them. It doesn't set the focus on hitting beat maps perfectly, but first and foremost you're here to defend your gate. The music conjures your mana resources, and you decide what to do with it. Your performance depends on your reflexes, your aim, and your tactical choices under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy the physicality of games like<strong> Pistol Whip</strong>, the magic combat of <strong>Blade &amp; Sorcery</strong>, and the wave-based intensity of <strong>Until You Fall</strong> — Step up to the stage and enjoy smashing monsters with magic to epic music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/6659e943757ac54c17885c7d3580ed83.avif?t=1770524781\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras_big/6659e943757ac54c17885c7d3580ed83.webp?t=1770524781 width=1560 height=141 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your scenario with the help (or distraction) of the tree companions Drog and Bog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 10 different songs on 3 distinct difficulties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on 3 different maps and defend against 3 different enemy types each with unique traits and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn achievements and customizations like hand models, enemy skins and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb separate leaderboards for each song on each difficulty.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RHYTHMIC is a VR spell-combat game where music is LITERALLY magic! <br>The rhythm will spawn mana particles that you must collect to conjure your spells. Each song is one round of intense physics-based magic combat. Stand as the last defender of your realm against relentless waves of enemies, intent on breaching your gate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/5d3868778b46285a93a9b3cc1235f7cb.avif?t=1770524781\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras_big/5d3868778b46285a93a9b3cc1235f7cb.webp?t=1770524781 width=1560 height=141 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/a21125a5da9d3e266498e54d2ebf837d.poster.avif?t=1770524781\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/a21125a5da9d3e266498e54d2ebf837d.webm?t=1770524781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/a21125a5da9d3e266498e54d2ebf837d.mp4?t=1770524781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the music and gather your mana. Throw spells at invaders and exploit their weaknesses! Each map hosts a different kind of enemy type, each with their own unique abilities. Prove your coordination and cunning to survive each song.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/505f43271c996c186ddf9c87f18389ba.avif?t=1770524781\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras_big/505f43271c996c186ddf9c87f18389ba.webp?t=1770524781 width=1560 height=141 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/cbfbd8a9d6aa5a90f637a02f0538042b.poster.avif?t=1770524781\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/cbfbd8a9d6aa5a90f637a02f0538042b.webm?t=1770524781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/cbfbd8a9d6aa5a90f637a02f0538042b.mp4?t=1770524781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The music is the source of all power in this realm! Magical particles spawn in tune with the rhythm. Catch as many as you can to power your spells!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/14264c8207f9bfec75f834484d386b3d.avif?t=1770524781\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras_big/14264c8207f9bfec75f834484d386b3d.webp?t=1770524781 width=1560 height=141 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/2b340d5d78b4b83532a32ab4142cef97.poster.avif?t=1770524781\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/2b340d5d78b4b83532a32ab4142cef97.webm?t=1770524781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/2b340d5d78b4b83532a32ab4142cef97.mp4?t=1770524781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They will attack relentlessly! Aim well, exploit each enemy's weakness with the right kind of magic, and play around their abilities to be as effective as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/6c31645bf9b49a0b507fa65eeb9eec20.avif?t=1770524781\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras_big/6c31645bf9b49a0b507fa65eeb9eec20.webp?t=1770524781 width=1560 height=141 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/ceaa2a5abaa4581bb9e280bb13066606.poster.avif?t=1770524781\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/ceaa2a5abaa4581bb9e280bb13066606.webm?t=1770524781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/ceaa2a5abaa4581bb9e280bb13066606.mp4?t=1770524781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out! Some enemies will fight back. Avoid their attacks or lose your charged mana, take too many hits and you will face an early defeat! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚔️ Not Your Typical Rhythm Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RHYTHMIC borrows from several genres but plays like none of them. It doesn't set the focus on hitting beat maps perfectly, but first and foremost you're here to defend your gate. The music conjures your mana resources, and you decide what to do with it. Your performance depends on your reflexes, your aim, and your tactical choices under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy the physicality of games like<strong> Pistol Whip</strong>, the magic combat of <strong>Blade &amp; Sorcery</strong>, and the wave-based intensity of <strong>Until You Fall</strong> — Step up to the stage and enjoy smashing monsters with magic to epic music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/6659e943757ac54c17885c7d3580ed83.avif?t=1770524781\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras_big/6659e943757ac54c17885c7d3580ed83.webp?t=1770524781 width=1560 height=141 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your scenario with the help (or distraction) of the tree companions Drog and Bog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 10 different songs on 3 distinct difficulties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on 3 different maps and defend against 3 different enemy types each with unique traits and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn achievements and customizations like hand models, enemy skins and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb separate leaderboards for each song on each difficulty.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Become a battle mage fueled by music! Every song spawns magical energy — catch it to charge your spells, then hurl them at waves of invading enemies. Exploit their weaknesses, dodge their counterattacks, and prevent them from breaking your gate!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/fd37998b285fee71bb6971f17af7669ad8e0dedb/header.jpg?t=1770524781", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/afabd34ac2dab6a7507dfd7c57ee5771b4de37f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770524781", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/afabd34ac2dab6a7507dfd7c57ee5771b4de37f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770524781", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9600K / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></l